medicine.desc1:
{Basic Medicine}

Increases the health of allied creatures by 5%
Allows you to control a First Aid Tent healing 26-50 points of damage

medicine.desc2:
{Advanced Medicine}

Increases the health of allied creatures by 10%
Allows you to control a First Aid Tent healing 51-75 points of damage

medicine.desc3:
{Expert Medicine}

Increases the health of allied creatures by 15% (minumum 1)
Allows you to control a First Aid Tent healing 76-100 points of damage
